WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:01.420
- After Mike's accident,

00:00:01.420 --> 00:00:03.760
we all sat together at the kitchen table.

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:05.750
He had big dreams of passing the farm down

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:08.680
to his five kids, and
their kids too one day.

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:11.585
We took a difficult situation
and helped turn it around.

00:00:11.585 --> 00:00:14.916
(expressive piano music)

